{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stranded in deep space, you must survive against all odds. Scavenge from wreckage, process resources, and build your own space station - a refuge in the most hostile of environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018760/extras/BuildBanner.gif?t=1733718031\" />Using a modular construction system, build your very own space stations to house farms, labs, and material processing equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018760/extras/OperateBanner.gif?t=1733718031\" />Take the role of a flight engineer and keep your station's equipment running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018760/extras/SurviveBanner.gif?t=1733718031\" />Stranded in deep space means food and water isn't exactly easy to come by. Explore wrecked stations, build farms, and mine asteroids for valuable resources to ensure your survival in the hostile abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018760/extras/ExpandBanner.gif?t=1733718031\" />Build and operate science facilities to unlock new schematics to expand and improve your station.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3018760?t=1733718031","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3018760?t=1733718031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018760/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1733718031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018760/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1733718031","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stranded in deep space, you must survive against all odds. Scavenge from wreckage, process resources, and build your own space station - a refuge in the most hostile of environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018760/extras/BuildBanner.gif?t=1733718031\" />Using a modular construction system, build your very own space stations to house farms, labs, and material processing equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018760/extras/OperateBanner.gif?t=1733718031\" />Take the role of a flight engineer and keep your station's equipment running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018760/extras/SurviveBanner.gif?t=1733718031\" />Stranded in deep space means food and water isn't exactly easy to come by. Explore wrecked stations, build farms, and mine asteroids for valuable resources to ensure your survival in the hostile abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018760/extras/ExpandBanner.gif?t=1733718031\" />Build and operate science facilities to unlock new schematics to expand and improve your station.</p>","developers":["True Anomaly Entertainment"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2763310","name":"Untethered"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301